# cakebear owns this file: upstream (microsoft/TypeScript) keeps its
# .gitattributes at the monorepo root, outside the tsc/ tree cakebear syncs.
# These are its rules, unchanged. `* -text` matters most: the compiler test
# baselines under testdata/ are compared byte for byte, so git must never
# convert their line endings.
*.js linguist-language=TypeScript
**/*.json linguist-language=jsonc
* -text
*.go text eol=lf
